WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.015
Dramatisation uses costume, gesture, dialogue, expression and purposeful movement to

00:00:05.015 --> 00:00:06.941
show character and meaning.

00:00:07.783 --> 00:00:12.519
Why is a story's setting useful? Answer: It tells where or when events happen.

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:18.280
Perform a two-minute sketch based on a reading story; select a safe costume to help

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:18.935
show character.

00:00:19.783 --> 00:00:22.770
Why it works: Setting places events in a context.
